        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puppy Link - Tile Connect</strong> is a cozy, dog-themed sanctuary where puzzle-solving meets adorable companionship. Unwind, interact with cute puppies, and slowly fill up your very own <strong>Hall of Honor</strong> with memories and trophies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🧩 Classic Gameplay, Gentle Challenge</strong> At its core, Puppy Link is a classic tile-connect experience. Your goal is simple: tap two identical tiles that can be linked with <strong>no more than two turns</strong> to clear the board. While the rules are easy to pick up, planning your routes and spotting pairs against the clock will provide a satisfying challenge to your <strong>observation and memory</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🐶 Adorable Company &amp; Vibes</strong> Immerse yourself in a relaxing atmosphere with soothing background music and a variety of <strong>wallpaper themes</strong> to match your mood. Need a break from the puzzle? <strong>Tap on the puppies</strong> on the screen! Watch their adorable reactions as they keep you company throughout your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🏆 Hundreds of Stages &amp; Achievements</strong> Whether you want a quick game or a long session, we've got you covered with <strong>Small, Medium, and Large boards</strong>, each featuring <strong>100 handcrafted stages</strong> (with more challenges waiting ahead). For players who love long-term goals, our rich <strong>Achievement System</strong> records every step of your progress. Strive for greatness and watch your Hall of Honor grow busier and brighter with every win!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay mut